' Missing File (M4 example): load a file that must not exist and show that
' the program reports it, keeps going, and leaves the variable unchanged.
' Reads only; never writes. PBNOFILE.TXT must not exist in the folder.
DIM Got$ AS STRING
Got$ = "unchanged"
FILELOAD "PBNOFILE.TXT", Got$
MESSAGE "Still running; Got$ is " + Got$
FILELOAD "PBNOFILE.TXT", Got$
MESSAGE "Second try done; Got$ is " + Got$
END
